# Copy to `.env` to override the defaults in compose.dev.yaml. Docker Compose
# reads it automatically. Note this file is read by Compose only -- `dotnet
# watch` on the host uses server/appsettings.Development.json instead.
#
# Everything is commented out because the defaults already work. Uncomment a
# line only when you want to change it.
#
# Settings for a production deploy (domain, admin bootstrap) are listed in
# TODO.md -- no code reads them yet, so listing them here would be misleading.

# --- Connection string the API container uses ---
# Uncomment and edit to point the API at an external database. Add
# `SSL Mode=Require` when the traffic leaves the machine.
# DB_CONNECTION=Host=db.example.com;Database=hakutaku;Username=hakutaku;Password=xxx;SSL Mode=Require
